k feature creates 10GB VM bundle on macOS without warning\n 6. [ 12.0] TechCrunch AI\n     Anthropic’s Claude reports widespread outage\n 7. [ 12.0] The Verge AI\n     How OpenAI caved to the Pentagon on AI surveillance\n 8. [ 10.5] TechCrunch AI\n     No one has a good plan for how AI companies should work with the government\n 9. [ 10.5] The Verge AI\n     Apple might use Google servers to store data for its upgraded AI Siri\n10. [  9.0] Techmeme\n     Alibaba releases the open-weight Qwen3.5 Small Model Series in 0.8B, 2B, 4B, and\n11. [  9.0] TechCrunch AI\n     ChatGPT uninstalls surged by 295% after DoD deal\n12. [  9.0] TechCrunch AI\n     Anthropic’s Claude rises to No. 1 in the App Store following Pentagon dispute\n13. [  8.0] MIT Tech Review\n     OpenAI’s “compromise” with the Pentagon is what Anthropic feared\n14. [  7.5] Techmeme\n     Sources: US considers limiting Chinese companies to 75K Nvidia H200 chips each, \n15. [  7.5] Techmeme\n     Anthropic's $60B+ in funding, half of which came just last month, from over 200 \n16. [  6.0] VNExpress Tech\n     'Mối nhân duyên' Anthropic và Lầu Năm Góc đổ vỡ thế nào\n17. [  5.0] Tinh tế Tech\n     Apple ra mắt iPad Air M4: 2 kích thước màn hình, thiết kế không đổi, chip M4, gi\n18. [  4.0] VNExpress Tech\n     iPhone 17e hỗ trợ MagSafe, thêm màu hồng, giá từ 18 triệu đồng\n19. [  4.0] VNExpress Tech\n     iPad Air M4 trình làng với RAM 12 GB\n20. [  4.0] Tinh tế Tech\n     Lộ đoạn video màn hình iPhone cũng có chống nhìn trộm Privacy Display?\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":6394,"aggregated":"==================================================\nAI News Digest — 2026-03-03 08:00\n==================================================\n\n[FETCH] Techmeme: https://www.techmeme.com/feed.xml\n  → 15 tin trong 48h qua\n[FETCH] Hacker News: https://hnrss.org/best\n  → 29 tin trong 48h qua\n[FETCH] TechCrunch AI: https://techcrunch.com/catego