{"type":"message","id":"e7e6d2cf","parentId":"eefb6a84","timestamp":"2026-03-03T01:00:34.308Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01XAAaCXTd5Rjs9U9ZFprMSs","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"fetched_at\": \"2026-03-03T01:00:32.326699+00:00\",\n  \"total_before_filter\": 74,\n  \"top_count\": 20,\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Anthropic upgrades Claude’s memory to attract AI switchers\",\n      \"link\": \"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/887885/anthropic-claude-memory-upgrades-importing\",\n      \"source\": \"The Verge AI\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-02T22:29:46+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"Anthropic is making it easier to switch to its Claude AI from other chatbots with an update that brings Claude's memory feature to users on the free plan, along with a new prompt and dedicated tool fo\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"AI\",\n        \"Anthropic\",\n        \"News\",\n        \"Tech\"\n      ],\n      \"score\": 18.0,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"prompt\",\n        \"Claude\",\n        \"Anthropic\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Anthropic brings Claude's memory feature to free users, after launching it for paid users in 2025 (Igor Bonifacic/Engadget)\",\n      \"link\": \"http://www.techmeme.com/260302/p44#a260302p44\",\n      \"source\": \"Techmeme\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-03T00:55:00+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"Igor Bonifacic / Engadget:\\nAnthropic brings Claude's memory feature to free users, after launching it for paid users in 2025&nbsp; &mdash;&nbsp; It's the latest upgrade to arrive for free users.&nbsp;\",\n      \"tags\": [],\n      \"score\": 13.5,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"Claude\",\n        \"Anthropic\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The US Treasury Department, State Department, and federal housing agency are ending use of Anthropic products; State Department says it will switch to OpenAI (Reuters)\",\n      \"link\": \"http://www.techmeme.com/260302/p38#a260302p38\",\n      \"source\": \"Techmeme\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-02T22:50:14+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"Reuters:\\nThe US Treasury Department, State Department, and federal housing agency are ending use of Anthropic products; State Department says it will switch to OpenAI&nbsp; &mdash;&nbsp; The U.S. Trea\",\n      \"tags\": [],\n      \"score\": 13.5,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"OpenAI\",\n        \"Anthropic\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Sources: amid negotiations with the DOD, Anthropic submitted a bid to compete in a $100M DOD contest to develop voice-controlled, autonomous drone swarming tech (Katrina Manson/Bloomberg)\",\n      \"link\": \"http://www.techmeme.com/260302/p41#a260302p41\",\n      \"source\": \"Techmeme\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-02T23:25:04+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"Katrina Manson / Bloomberg:\\nSources: amid negotiations with the DOD, Anthropic submitted a bid to compete in a $100M DOD contest to develop voice-controlled, autonomous drone swarming tech&nbsp; &mdas\",\n      \"tags\": [],\n      \"score\": 12.0,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"autonomous\",\n        \"Anthropic\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Anthropic Cowork feature creates 10GB VM bundle on macOS without warning\",\n      \"link\": \"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/22543\",\n      \"source\": \"Hacker News\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-02T14:21:19+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"Article URL: https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/22543\\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47218288\\nPoints: 351\\n# Comments: 178\",\n      \"tags\": [],\n      \"score\": 12.0,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"Claude\",\n        \"Anthropic\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Anthropic’s Claude reports widespread outage\",\n      \"link\": \"https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/02/anthropics-claude-reports-widespread-outage/\",\n      \"source\": \"TechCrunch AI\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-02T13:31:49+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"Anthropic's AI chatbot Claude experienced widespread service disruptions on Monday morning, with thousands of users reporting issues accessing the bot.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"AI\",\n        \"Outage\",\n        \"Anthropic\",\n        \"Claude\",\n        \"In Brief\"\n      ],\n      \"score\": 12.0,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"Claude\",\n        \"Anthropic\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How OpenAI caved to the Pentagon on AI surveillance\",\n      \"link\": \"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/887309/openai-anthropic-dod-military-pentagon-contract-sam-altman-hegseth\",\n      \"source\": \"The Verge AI\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-02T14:22:18+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"On Friday evening, amidst fallout from a standoff between the Department of Defense and Anthropic, OpenAI CEO Sam Altman announced that his own company had successfully negotiated new terms with the P\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"AI\",\n        \"Analysis\",\n        \"Anthropic\",\n        \"OpenAI\",\n        \"Report\"\n      ],\n      \"score\": 12.0,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"OpenAI\",\n        \"Anthropic\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"No one has a good plan for how AI companies should work with the government\",\n      \"link\": \"https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/02/openai-anthropic-department-of-defense-war-hegseth-ai-companies-work-with-us-government/\",\n      \"source\": \"TechCrunch AI\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-02T22:59:10+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"As OpenAI transitions from a wildly successful consumer startup into a piece of national security infrastructure, the company seems unequipped to manage its new responsibilities.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"AI\",\n        \"Government & Policy\",\n        \"Analysis\",\n        \"Exclusive\",\n        \"sam altman\",\n        \"OpenAI\",\n        \"Anthropic\",\n        \"defense contracting\"\n      ],\n      \"score\": 10.5,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"OpenAI\",\n        \"startup\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Apple might use Google servers to store data for its upgraded AI Siri\",\n      \"link\": \"https://www.theverge.com/tech/887802/apple-ai-siri-google-servers\",\n      \"source\": \"The Verge AI\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-02T20:22:33+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"Apple has asked Google to look into \\\"setting up servers\\\" for a new version of Siri that's Gemini-powered and meets Apple's privacy requirements, The Information reports. Apple had already announced in\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"AI\",\n        \"Apple\",\n        \"Google\",\n        \"Tech\"\n      ],\n      \"score\": 10.5,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"privacy\",\n        \"Gemini\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Alibaba releases the open-weight Qwen3.5 Small Model Series in 0.8B, 2B, 4B, and 9B sizes, claiming the 9B model rivals OpenAI's gpt-oss-120b on some benchmarks (Carl Franzen/VentureBeat)\",\n      \"link\": \"http://www.techmeme.com/260302/p34#a260302p34\",\n      \"source\": \"Techmeme\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-02T20:40:14+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"Carl Franzen / VentureBeat:\\nAlibaba releases the open-weight Qwen3.5 Small Model Series in 0.8B, 2B, 4B, and 9B sizes, claiming the 9B model rivals OpenAI's gpt-oss-120b on some benchmarks&nbsp; &mdas\",\n      \"tags\": [],\n      \"score\": 9.0,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"OpenAI\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"ChatGPT uninstalls surged by 295% after DoD deal\",\n      \"link\": \"https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/02/chatgpt-uninstalls-surged-by-295-after-dod-deal/\",\n      \"source\": \"TechCrunch AI\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-03T00:03:37+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"Many consumers ditched ChatGPT's app after news of its DoD deal went live, while Claude's downloads grew.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"AI\",\n        \"Apps\",\n        \"Anthropic\",\n        \"ChatGPT\",\n        \"Claude\",\n        \"department of defense\",\n        \"Exclusive\",\n        \"OpenAI\"\n      ],\n      \"score\": 9.0,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"Claude\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Anthropic’s Claude rises to No. 1 in the App Store following Pentagon dispute\",\n      \"link\": \"https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/01/anthropics-claude-rises-to-no-2-in-the-app-store-following-pentagon-dispute/\",\n      \"source\": \"TechCrunch AI\",\n      \"source_weight\": 1.5,\n      \"region\": \"intl\",\n      \"published\": \"2026-03-01T14:48:58+00:00\",\n      \"summary\": \"Anthropic’s chatbot Claude seems to have benefited from the attention around the company’s fraught negotiations with the Pentagon.\",\n      \"tags\": [\n        \"AI\",\n        \"Government & Policy\",\n        \"Anthropic\",\n        \"Claude\",\n        \"In Brief\",\n        \"OpenAI\",\n        \"pentagon\"\n      ],\n      \"score\": 9.0,\n      \"matched_keywords\": [\n        \"Claude\",\n        \"Anthropic\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"OpenAI’s “compromise” with the Pentagon is what Anthropic feared\",\n      \"